{"status":"ready","content":"I need to multiply these two large numbers exactly:\r\n123456789123456789 × 987654321987654321\r\n\r\nLet me break this down using the standard multiplication algorithm.\r\n\r\nFirst, let me notice that:\r\n- 123456789123456789 = 123456789 × 10^9 + 123456789\r\n- 987654321987654321 = 987654321 × 10^9 + 987654321\r\n\r\nSo I can write:\r\n123456789123456789 = 123456789 × (10^9 + 1)\r\n987654321987654321 = 987654321 × (10^9 + 1)\r\n\r\nTherefore:\r\n123456789123456789 × 987654321987654321 = 123456789 × 987654321 × (10^9 + 1)^2\r\n\r\nFirst, let me calculate 123456789 × 987654321:\r\n123456789 × 987654321 = 121932631112635269\r\n\r\nNow I need to calculate (10^9 + 1)^2:\r\n(10^9 + 1)^2 = 10^18 + 2 × 10^9 + 1\r\n\r\nSo:\r\n121932631112635269 × (10^18 + 2 × 10^9 + 1)\r\n= 121932631112635269 × 10^18 + 121932631112635269 × 2 × 10^9 + 121932631112635269\r\n= 121932631112635269000000000000000000 + 243865262225270538000000000 + 121932631112635269\r\n= 121932631112635269243865262225270538121932631112635269\r\n\r\nTherefore:\r\n123456789123456789 × 987654321987654321 = 121932631112635269243865262225270538121932631112635269\r\n","path":"responses/claude-opus-4/huge-multiplication.txt","size":1089,"mtime":1778576319.456329}